@startuml
title Диаграмма коммуникации — Создание заказа (микросервисы)

actor Customer
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Notification Service" as Notification
participant "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Payment Gateway" as PaymentGateway

Customer --> UI : 1. Оформляет заказ
UI --> Gateway : 2. POST /orders
Gateway --> Order : 3. CreateOrder (gRPC)

Order -> Order : 4. Создаёт агрегат Order (NEW)
Order -> Order : 5. Сохраняет OrderCreated в Event Store
Order --> Kafka : 6. Публикует OrderCreated

Order --> Payment : 7. ProcessPayment (Saga шаг 1)
Payment -> Payment : 8. Создаёт платёж (PENDING)
Payment --> PaymentGateway : 9. Authorize payment
PaymentGateway --> Payment : 10. Payment success
Payment -> Payment : 11. Обновляет статус на SUCCESS
Payment --> Kafka : 12. Публикует PaymentCompleted
Payment --> Order : 13. Payment completed

Order --> Inventory : 14. ReserveStock (Saga шаг 2)
Inventory -> Inventory : 15. Проверяет остатки
Inventory -> Inventory : 16. Резервирует товары
Inventory --> Kafka : 17. Публикует InventoryReserved
Inventory --> Order : 18. Stock reserved

Order --> Notification : 19. SendOrderConfirmation (Saga шаг 3)
Notification -> Notification : 20. Формирует уведомление
Notification --> Kafka : 21. Публикует NotificationRequest
Notification --> Order : 22. Notification sent

Order -> Order : 23. Обновляет статус на PAID
Order --> Kafka : 24. Публикует OrderPaid
Order --> Gateway : 25. Order created
Gateway --> UI : 26. 202 Accepted
UI --> Customer : 27. Заказ создан

@enduml